# gh issue close 1 --repo alice/site
### read
POST https://api.github.com/graphql
accept: application/vnd.github.merge-info-preview+json, application/vnd.github.nebula-preview
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
graphql-features: merge_queue
user-agent: GitHub CLI 2.83.2

{"query":"\n\tquery IssueByNumber($owner: String!, $repo: String!, $number: Int!) {\n\t\trepository(owner: $owner, name: $repo) {\n\t\t\thasIssuesEnabled\n\t\t\tissue: issueOrPullRequest(number: $number) {\n\t\t\t\t__typename\n\t\t\t\t...on Issue{id,number,title,state}\n\t\t\t\t...on PullRequest{id,number,title,state}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t}","variables":{"number":1,"owner":"alice","repo":"site"}}

### write
POST https://api.github.com/graphql
accept: application/vnd.github.merge-info-preview+json, application/vnd.github.nebula-preview
content-type: application/json
graphql-features: merge_queue
user-agent: GitHub CLI 2.83.2

{"query":"mutation IssueClose($input:CloseIssueInput!){closeIssue(input: $input){issue{id}}}","variables":{"input":{"issueId":"I_kwDOAlice1"}}}

